[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20461.39, "timestamp": "05:41:01", "text": "大概就两三分钟吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20466.75, "timestamp": "05:41:06", "text": "这点时间就能搞定，所以我很快就做好了。嗨！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20469.27, "timestamp": "05:41:09", "text": "希望那件事真的会发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20473.43, "timestamp": "05:41:13", "text": "YouTube 正好支持高清处理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20476.628, "timestamp": "05:41:16", "text": "所以我希望在我剪辑完高清版之后，它能被高清版收录。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20479.83, "timestamp": "05:41:19", "text": "处理已经恢复了，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20483.75, "timestamp": "05:41:23", "text": "明天，所以，嗯，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20484.99, "timestamp": "05:41:24", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20488.708, "timestamp": "05:41:28", "text": "我说今天就到此为止吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20493.628, "timestamp": "05:41:33", "text": "我好 Hony hon hon"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20497.75, "timestamp": "05:41:37", "text": "感谢你今天陪在我身边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20500.788, "timestamp": "05:41:40", "text": "并且一直待到最后，真的真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20505.15, "timestamp": "05:41:45", "text": "这对我很有意义，所以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20508.91, "timestamp": "05:41:48", "text": "今天就到这里吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20512.468, "timestamp": "05:41:52", "text": "还有，我昨天忘了提这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20516.708, "timestamp": "05:41:56", "text": "我们和 Heron 一起直播，还做了个 YouTube 直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20518.468, "timestamp": "05:41:58", "text": "等待 Twitch 直播"}]